    {
        "id": "8ebee3b55772fac1",
        "type": "subflow",
        "name": "View",
        "info": "Renders a page (public/pages) or a component (public/components).\n\n- HTMX request (HX-Request header): only the rendered file.\n- Direct request (F5, link, history restore): the file is placed into the <slot> of the layout public/<layout>.html.\n\nComponents (<Name/>) are resolved in the file and in the layout, then everything is rendered once with Mustache using msg as data. Errors return 500.\n\nEnv: type - page or component, name - file name, layout - layout file name (default index).",
        "category": "",
        "in": [
            {
                "x": 40,
                "y": 260,
